    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This is an auto spin macro for roblox fruit battlegrounds  so that you can automatically spin without the game pass. in game just set the auto spin requirement to whatever rarity you want (that feature works without the gamepass) and start the macro. the pop up to prevent you from spinning away the desired rarity will end the auto spin.

Designed for resolution: 1920 x 1080</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 
I love you nefatos | Я люблю тебя, нефатос</Comment>
